    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Meteorite! We've managed to push the Yeti Squadron back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I seem to have underestimated you, Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps I held back a bit too much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I can't feel my fingers anymore... Damn it...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What's going on...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "The cold current... is still gathering around her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This time...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "You won't be so lucky.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "...? !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh no...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is she trying to absorb all the ice surrounding us and release it at once? !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014\u2669\u2014\u2014\u266c\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "...She's going to drain all the heat from our bodies!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "These Arts are on a complete different scale from what we saw before...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let it all come to an end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "May your anger be buried by purest frost.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Nnngh...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...\u2669...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
