        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't I already tell you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't let you... come any closer...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1505_frstar_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Did you disrupt my cold current using your own Arts?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
    },
    {
        "text": "...What a good kid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "FrostNova"
